cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2d2a01b41ecf19ec1557.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48344-1-12-2","ko":"어느 쪽이 어떻게 아파요? 얼른 약을 사 가지고 올게요.","zh":"是哪边疼？我马上去买药回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어느","meaning":"某","explanation":"어느：某","readings":[{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62822","senseId":"1","lemma":"어느","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}},{"text":"쪽이","meaning":"边","explanation":"쪽：边；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"쪽","audio":"/audio/077b6c57af048c3baee6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58147","senseId":"1","lemma":"쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쪽이","audio":"/audio/713752120e43389e4ac4.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"아파요?","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파요","audio":"/audio/0d77fc96982cfc284c03.mp3"}},{"text":"얼른","meaning":"快地","explanation":"얼른：快地","readings":[{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67315","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}},{"text":"약을","meaning":"药","explanation":"약：药；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"1","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약을","audio":"/audio/f745a64b3ad605aada03.mp3"}},{"text":"사","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사","audio":"/audio/98ebd37ce3c1cd6abbe7.mp3"}},{"text":"가지고","meaning":"用，拿","explanation":"가지다：用，拿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"9","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지고","audio":"/audio/2e847f33430d128ed48a.mp3"}},{"text":"올게요.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올게요","audio":"/audio/65fee9486bc51beeb1c3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"76e7139b030308e7","term":"어느","zh":"某","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3","entryId":"62822","definition":"多个中的哪一个。","pronunciation":["어느"]},{"id":"077b6c57af048c3b","term":"쪽","zh":"边","audio":"/audio/077b6c57af048c3baee6.mp3","entryId":"58147","definition":"进行或朝向的方向。","pronunciation":["쪽"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"d658f46882498576","term":"얼른","zh":"快地","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3","entryId":"67315","definition":"不拖延时间就。","pronunciation":["얼른"]},{"id":"2a9db5dfd1480367","term":"약","zh":"药","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.